
statistics:

L1 Cache Hit: Takes ~4 to 5 cycles (1 nanosecond).
L2 Cache Hit: Takes ~12 to 14 cycles (2.5 nanoseconds).
L3 Cache Hit: Takes ~40 to 60 cycles (10 nanoseconds).
Main Memory (RAM): Takes ~250 to 300 cycles (50 to 60 nanoseconds).

